5,1,1,talk,Minako,,Our current system is too vague. We need a structured way to handle costs and scheduling to ensure no one is unfairly subsidizing others.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. The informal nature is starting to create tension. We should find a solution that maintains our harmony while providing clarity.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,It is not just about the money. The car is often unavailable or dirty when I need it. We need reliability.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Exactly. We are operating on guesswork. I want to see the actual figures and a logical breakdown of who is actually driving.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I find the constant arranging and untangling of who owes what very stressful. I want something simpler.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"To get that simplicity, we first need the facts. I suggest we look into the actual costs and usage patterns.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,A wise approach. I am interested in why these arrangements usually fail so we can avoid the same pitfalls.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I want to know why the car is often in a poor state at handover and if there are repeating conflicts.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will focus on the money. We need the fuel receipts and the tax papers to see the real baseline.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I want to know how much time we actually spend managing this. Maybe the diary or the trial records?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I'll look into the tax and insurance papers, and also the fuel receipts to see the split.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will investigate what other households said and the experience of checking each other's figures.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll check the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll take the fuel receipts as well, and the hours of use recorded in the diary.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look at the month's trial of recording every run and the weeks of heavy use.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
